WEBVTT

00:06:31.568 --> 00:06:33.705
To je bambusov lok,

00:06:33.705 --> 00:06:37.637
z 20 kilogrami vlečne teže.

00:06:37.637 --> 00:06:39.821
(Zvok izstreljene puščice)

00:06:39.821 --> 00:06:44.779
(Aplavz)

00:06:48.285 --> 00:06:52.694
Lok lahko funkcionira na preprost način,

00:06:52.694 --> 00:06:55.245
ampak da naredite dober lok,

00:06:55.245 --> 00:06:59.257
potrebujete veliko rahločutnosti.

00:06:59.257 --> 00:07:01.787
Morate se posvetovati in komunicirati